      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FALSTAFF.\nLet them go. I’ll through Gloucestershire, and there will I visit Master Robert Shallow, Esquire. I have him already tempering between my finger and my thumb, and shortly will I seal with him. Come away.",
